      "role": "user",
      "content": "i mean i get that, but some people argue it actually prevents candidates from just ignoring rural areas and focusing only on big cities like nyc or la. if we went to a popular vote, wouldn't that make the smaller states completely irrelevant? it seems like there's a valid argument for keeping it to keep the country balanced.",
